   "2_choke_volume": "存在 d ∈ [t-10, t-1]：vol_d > 0 且 vol_d <= k × max(vol_{d-60..d-1}) 且 vol_d <= 0.5 × VMA20_d；主規格 k＝0.35，另測 k＝0.25、0.50",
